; Tutorial_9_Conclusion.inix -- conclusion

[about]
Title=9 - Conclusion
Intro=What the walks covered, a glossary in two voices, and every way to get help with 2htm.
Setup=Nothing to set up; this walk only listens.
Homework=Convert the document you read most often, and keep its web page.

[step]

Say=That is 2htm. Here is what each walk gave you.
Key=

[step]

Say=Walk one, the dialog and a letter for everything. Walk two, installing and the three ways to start. Walks three to six: a Word report, a PDF, plain text, and slides and spreadsheets.
Key=

[step]

Say=Walk seven, a whole folder at once. Walk eight, File Explorer and the command line.
Key=

[step]

Say=Now a short glossary. I say the term; the other voice says what it means.
Key=

[step]

Say=Web page.
Key=
Hear=A document a browser shows, with headings, lists and tables a screen reader can move through by key.

[step]

Say=Plain text.
Key=
Hear=Words alone, with no formatting, for listening, braille or pasting into an email.

[step]

Say=Heading.
Key=
Hear=A title in the document's outline; the H key moves from one to the next.

[step]

Say=Scanned PDF.
Key=
Hear=A PDF made of pictures of pages, with no text inside until text recognition reads it.

[step]

Say=Output directory.
Key=
Hear=The folder where converted files are written; blank means beside each document.

[step]

Say=Help is never more than a key away. In the dialog, F1 shows Help, and Shift plus F1 says the tip for the control you are on.
Key=F1
Hear=2htm Help dialog
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=F7 lists the dialog's controls. Guide, Alt plus G, opens the full guide and returns to the dialog as you left it.
Key=Alt+G
Hear=Guide button
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=F11 checks for a newer version, and the 2htm page on GitHub has the latest release and a place to report a problem.
Key=

[step]

Say=Thank you for listening. Happy converting.
Key=
